flowchart TB
    U[Person in the studio] -->|idea| R{Enough to start?<br/>plain-code check}
    R -- no --> U
    R -- yes --> I[intake<br/>model drafts the brief]
    I --> C[clarify<br/>PAUSE: questions]
    C --> I
    C --> B[confirm_brief<br/>PAUSE: approve or edit]
    B --> RT[Research team<br/>supervisor + specialists]
    RT --> E[evaluate_candidates<br/>license gate + Laya decisions]
    E --> S[(Shortlist for the person)]
    S -->|person asks for options| D[draft_options]
    D --> V[review_options<br/>rules first, retries bounded]
    V --> SR[select_or_revise<br/>PAUSE: choose]
    SR -->|revise| D
    SR --> AP[approve_version<br/>PAUSE: approve]
    AP --> END((Approved option))